    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.210" end="00:01.710" ttm:agent="v1">Usher, baby</p>
      <p begin="00:01.590" end="00:06.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I just wanna get your attention (Ay girl, ay girl)</p>
      <p begin="00:06.330" end="00:09.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I really wanna be all up in your head (Turn the lights on)</p>
