      <p begin="01:40.460" end="01:46.170" ttm:agent="v1">Said, I'll get you hot, I know you oh so well</p>
      <p begin="01:46.170" end="01:49.570" ttm:agent="v1">And when I'm walk in all that I wanna hear</p>
      <p begin="01:49.570" end="01:55.230" ttm:agent="v1">Is you say, &quot;Daddy's home, home for me&quot;</p>
